of junk I might find, but enough to bless up to half a dozen key items
and still have enough left for other uses.

I generally don't carry around more than a few bottles; potions are
heavy, even in a BoH.  That's one reason why I prefer to bless items
in advance, since a blessed item weighs no more than an unblessed one.

